    "name": "SqlGlobalPropertiesOptions global connection-property options",
    "kind": "Library",
    "language": "csharp",
    "contract": "SqlGlobalPropertiesOptions is the concrete global-level options object for SQL connection properties. Consumers can create it without constructor arguments and supply global values through the inherited SqlConnectionPropertiesBase properties; SqlGlobalPropertiesOptions itself adds no independently configurable members."
